<title>NEW ZEALAND: New, ex-o/seas NZ vehicle registrations up in Oct.</title>
<headline>New, ex-o/seas NZ vehicle registrations up in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>New and ex-overseas vehicle registrations rose 17 percent to 21,061 in October from 17,946 a year ago, The Land Transport and Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>New and ex-overseas car registrations rose to 15,929 from 13,292, while those for trucks fell to 2,381 from 2,480.</p>
<p>Bus and coach registrations rose to 90 from 54 and tractors were up at 218 from 175.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
